    },
    {
      "Text": "An update for polkit is now available for openEuler-24.03-LTS-SP4",
      "Title": "Summary",
      "Type": "General"
    },
    {
      "Text": "polkit is a toolkit for defining and handling authorizations. It is used for allowing unprivileged processes to speak to privileged processes.\n\nSecurity Fix(es):\n\nA vulnerability, which was classified as very critical, was found in Polkit. The issue is a stack-based buffer overflow in the read_cookie function, which may impact confidentiality, integrity, and availability.(CVE-2026-85498)",
      "Title": "Description",
      "Type": "General"
    },
    {
      "Text": "An update for polkit is now available for openEuler-24.03-LTS-SP4.\n\nopenEuler Security has rated this update as having a security impact of medium. A Common Vunlnerability Scoring System(CVSS)base score,which gives a detailed severity rating, is available for each vulnerability from the CVElink(s) in the References section.",
      "Title": "Topic",
      "Type": "General"
    },
    {
      "Text": "Medium",
      "Title": "Severity",
      "Type": "General"
    },
    {
      "Text": "polkit",
      "Title": "Affected Component",
      "Type": "General"
    }
